   "text": "Scotland's Rural College (SRUC) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nScotland's Rural College (SRUC)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nScotland’s Rural College (SRUC) is a leading institution specialising in agriculture, environment, and business consulting. Offering degrees, research, and consultancy, SRUC supports innovation in sustainable land use, animal science, and food production. With campuses across Scotland, it plays a vital role in education and rural development.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:27\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:27\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £19,000.00\nMin: £16,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n22%\n350 of 1,570 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2012\nCampus(es)\nEdinburgh, Aberdeen, Barony, Oatridge\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/01/2023\nContract End Date\n29/02/2028\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.sruc.ac.uk/study-with-us/student-life/student-accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.sruc.ac.uk/study-with-us/find-apply-for-your-course/fees-funding/student-bursaries/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZie8fBQscdyTgmTKWnTMKA\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
